=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ChainCoverNumberWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ChainCoverNumberWitness}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}chain\\text{-}cover\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ChainCoverNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal C,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal C=P\\land|\\mathcal C|=\\kappa\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall x,y\\in C\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}chain\\text{-}cover\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ChainCoverNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal C,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal C=P\\land|\\mathcal C|=\\kappa\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall x,y\\in C\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary chain cover witness definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","h